WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:05.790
<b>TENPO YEAR 1 (1830)</b>

00:02.420 --> 00:05.710
<b>I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!</b>

00:05.710 --> 00:06.580
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:09.540 --> 00:10.670
<b>Annoying brat.</b>

00:11.170 --> 00:12.790
<b>You're a goddamn mistake.</b>

00:13.380 --> 00:14.080
<b>C'mere!</b>

00:15.540 --> 00:18.670
<b>No, please!</b>

00:19.330 --> 00:22.080
<b>Help me, Jinta!</b>

00:27.750 --> 00:28.710
<b>Wait, Dad!</b>

00:29.330 --> 00:30.460
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:34.790 --> 00:38.290
<b>I'm s-sorry...</b>

01:11.080 --> 01:13.960
<b>Suzune! Suzune!</b>

01:17.750 --> 01:18.630
<b>Suzune!</b>

01:29.130 --> 01:29.960
<b>Suzune?</b>

01:32.670 --> 01:33.960
<b>Jinta...</b>

01:34.540 --> 01:35.330
<b>Suzune!</b>

01:37.380 --> 01:39.540
<b>I'm sorry. I should have done something.</b>

01:39.710 --> 01:43.670
<b>Don't say that, Jinta. You're gonna get in trouble!</b>

01:44.830 --> 01:47.380
<b>Just forget about me and go back home.</b>

01:48.130 --> 01:48.750
<b>Okay?</b>

01:52.130 --> 01:52.960
<b>We're leaving.</b>

01:53.540 --> 01:54.210
<b>Huh?</b>

02:07.750 --> 02:09.580
<b>Are you getting cold, Suzune?</b>

02:09.880 --> 02:12.920
<b>Not with you here. I'll be fine.</b>

02:25.920 --> 02:28.630
<b>No place to go? Then come stay with me.</b>

02:32.420 --> 02:34.920
<b>Jinta? Jinta!</b>

02:36.790 --> 02:38.670
<b>Ah, good morning.</b>

02:45.830 --> 02:47.920
<b>Well, no more riding piggyback for you.</b>

02:48.880 --> 02:50.250
<b>Time to walk on your own.</b>

03:02.380 --> 03:04.250
<b>What a weird place...</b>

03:04.420 --> 03:09.080
<b>This village was built to house blacksmiths
who use large bellows to forge katana.</b>

03:12.830 --> 03:14.000
<b>Well, come on in.</b>

03:14.880 --> 03:16.790
<b>Daddy! Welcome home!</b>

03:17.630 --> 03:19.920
<b>Thank you. Have you been a good girl?</b>

03:20.290 --> 03:20.960
<b>Mm-hm!</b>

03:27.000 --> 03:27.830
<b>Who are they?</b>

03:28.500 --> 03:29.750
<b>Kids who need a home.</b>

03:30.540 --> 03:32.460
<b>So they're going to live with us from now on.</b>

03:33.130 --> 03:34.750
<b>You mean, in our house?</b>

03:34.920 --> 03:37.670
<b>Yes. I'm making them part of our family.</b>

03:38.330 --> 03:39.000
<b>Is that okay?</b>

03:40.170 --> 03:40.830
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:43.330 --> 03:46.000
<b>My name is Shirayuki! What's your name?</b>

03:46.460 --> 03:47.880
<b>J-Jinta...</b>

03:49.710 --> 03:53.290
<b>Hello there! Will you tell me your name, too?</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.210
<b>I'm Suzune.</b>

04:00.420 --> 04:01.540
<b>Thank you!</b>

04:03.790 --> 04:05.130
<b>Let's be friends, okay?</b>

04:05.750 --> 04:08.790
<b>All right. Shirayuki-chan...</b>

04:10.080 --> 04:11.420
<b>You don't need to call me that.</b>

04:11.880 --> 04:14.880
<b>Because from now on, we're all going to be family!</b>

04:31.250 --> 04:32.420
<b>Can't sleep?</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:39.540
<b>Are you a samurai, Motoharu-san?</b>

04:39.790 --> 04:41.710
<b>No. I'm a sentinel.</b>

04:44.500 --> 04:46.830
<b>I keep important things and people safe.</b>

05:55.130 --> 05:59.500
<b>You always eat too many dango, Shirayuki-chan.
We should go vegetable picking instead next time!</b>

05:59.710 --> 06:03.000
<b>I can't help it, Chitose-chan.
Your mom just makes the best dango.</b>

06:03.290 --> 06:04.250
<b>I know, right?</b>

06:04.250 --> 06:05.290
<b>Chitose!</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:06.960
<b>My mom's calling me.</b>

06:07.330 --> 06:08.330
<b>Bye for now!</b>

06:08.330 --> 06:09.130
<b>See you later!</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:10.540
<b>Bye to you, too, Jinta-nii!</b>

06:11.830 --> 06:13.630
<b>I'm back, Mommy!</b>

06:14.080 --> 06:18.170
<b>Guess what? My friends and I went to the river today
to play in the water and we had so much fun...</b>

06:31.420 --> 06:33.330
<b>So, about your mom...</b>

06:34.290 --> 06:36.500
<b>Her name is Yokaze, right?</b>

06:37.170 --> 06:41.830
<b>I know she was the one who helped us get
the permission we needed to live here in Kadono village.</b>

06:44.420 --> 06:46.540
<b>She never leaves that shrine, huh?</b>

06:47.290 --> 06:50.170
<b>Yeah. It's because she's the Itsukihime.</b>

06:50.710 --> 06:51.710
<b>What's that?</b>

06:52.330 --> 06:55.330
<b>Well, it's another name for the Miko of the Fire God.</b>

06:56.040 --> 07:00.920
<b>The only people allowed to see the Itsukihime
are the village chieftain and our dad, her sentinel.</b>

07:02.080 --> 07:07.830
<b>The rules say the Itsukihime can't interact with
regular people, because it might taint her holy powers.</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:12.290
<b>It's been years since I last saw her myself...</b>

07:14.630 --> 07:16.500
<b>Come on. Let's go home.</b>

07:16.960 --> 07:18.920
<b>TENPO YEAR 3 (1833)</b>

07:34.210 --> 07:35.460
<b>Still not good enough.</b>

07:36.710 --> 07:37.960
<b>Well, only practice makes perfect.</b>

07:37.960 --> 07:39.540
<b>Yeah, yeah!</b>

07:40.250 --> 07:43.670
<b>But y'know, it feels like I haven't made
any progress at all...</b>

07:46.880 --> 07:47.960
<b>Listen, Jinta.</b>

07:48.380 --> 07:50.040
<b>Nothing is forever.</b>

07:50.420 --> 07:53.000
<b>Although you may feel like you're still the same,</b>

07:53.250 --> 07:55.500
<b>the reality is that you've been changing little by little.</b>

07:56.830 --> 07:59.580
<b>So buck up. You'll get tougher in time.</b>

08:00.460 --> 08:01.960
<b>I guarantee it.</b>

08:02.790 --> 08:03.500
<b>Okay.</b>

08:03.830 --> 08:06.500
<b>Well, it's time for me to go fulfill my duties.</b>

08:06.920 --> 08:07.960
<b>Motoharu-san!</b>

08:08.420 --> 08:09.790
<b>Thanks for training me.</b>

08:10.210 --> 08:10.960
<b>Sure.</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:19.790
<b>Daddy! Don't forget this!</b>

08:19.790 --> 08:20.880
<b>Why thank you.</b>

08:23.000 --> 08:24.460
<b>Be safe!</b>

08:24.460 --> 08:25.290
<b>Will do.</b>

08:36.210 --> 08:37.500
<b>Too bad that you lost.</b>

08:38.040 --> 08:39.000
<b>Does it still hurt?</b>

08:39.460 --> 08:40.460
<b>Cut it out.</b>

08:40.710 --> 08:44.380
<b>Aw, don't be like that. I'm trying to be
a good big sister and cheer you up.</b>

08:44.540 --> 08:48.040
<b>How are you my big sister? You're younger than me.</b>

08:48.580 --> 08:51.920
<b>Because I've got my act together!
That makes me the mature one!</b>

08:56.830 --> 08:58.420
<b>Wah! S-Suzune!</b>

08:58.420 --> 09:00.380
<b>Good morning, Jinta...</b>

09:01.830 --> 09:02.920
<b>What's the matter?</b>

09:02.920 --> 09:05.330
<b>Uh, it's nothing!</b>

09:07.330 --> 09:09.630
<b>Okay. It's time for breakfast.</b>

09:09.630 --> 09:10.210
<b>Yay!</b>

09:15.500 --> 09:16.130
<b>Right.</b>

09:20.500 --> 09:23.630
<b>Once again, your demon-slaying skills prove impeccable.</b>

09:24.210 --> 09:28.380
<b>Jinta. You never falter in the face
of those flesh-eating monsters.</b>

09:29.000 --> 09:30.960
<b>Your stalwart dedication is to be admired.</b>

09:31.670 --> 09:36.130
<b>Not at all. I am merely fulfilling my duties
as the village sentinel.</b>

09:37.080 --> 09:39.380
<b>What sort of demon was it this time?</b>

09:39.670 --> 09:43.330
<b>It used a human disguise to try and sneak
into Kadono unnoticed.</b>

09:46.080 --> 09:48.880
<b>Then it must have been after our princess.</b>

09:55.290 --> 09:58.710
<b>Demons naturally have a lifespan
that lasts over a thousand years.</b>

09:59.000 --> 10:02.670
<b>But legend has it that eating the fresh liver
of a Miko can make them immortal.</b>

10:03.290 --> 10:05.920
<b>Oh please, we don't even know
if that folktale is true or not.</b>

10:05.920 --> 10:09.960
<b>Does it matter? The previous Itsukihime,
Yokaze, was in fact eaten by a demon.</b>

10:10.170 --> 10:14.540
<b>And we only managed to put an end
to the monster after Motoharu gave his life.</b>

10:16.130 --> 10:18.170
<b>It's possible they seek to obtain Yarai.</b>

10:18.920 --> 10:21.830
<b>The sacred sword passed down
to the Itsukihime for generations.</b>

10:22.580 --> 10:24.960
<b>I imagine it holds great value to the demons, as well.</b>

10:25.290 --> 10:25.960
<b>Perhaps.</b>

10:26.790 --> 10:30.750
<b>The story goes that Yarai was created
by using the best smithing techniques in Kadono.</b>

10:30.830 --> 10:34.880
<b>It is a mystical katana that has remained
in pristine shape for well over a century.</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:40.330
<b>Now the demons seek to wield its power.
Is that what you suggest?</b>

10:41.670 --> 10:42.670
<b>However...</b>

10:43.580 --> 10:45.380
<b>Yes, I know what you wish to say.</b>

10:50.960 --> 10:54.670
<b>Don't get your loincloth in such a twist, Father.</b>

10:54.880 --> 10:58.540
<b>You realize the Itsukihime now
has two sentinels protecting her, don't you?</b>

10:58.750 --> 10:59.710
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

11:00.250 --> 11:04.630
<b>Although one of them is an oddball with no talent
for anything except swinging a sword around.</b>

11:05.130 --> 11:05.920
<b>Right?</b>

11:06.250 --> 11:07.500
<b>You got a problem with me?</b>

11:08.130 --> 11:11.960
<b>You know this sacred shrine
is no place for such petty quarrels.</b>

11:12.500 --> 11:14.420
<b>Yes. Please accept my apologies.</b>

11:14.710 --> 11:16.630
<b>That applies to you as well, Kiyomasa.</b>

11:16.830 --> 11:17.880
<b>Seriously?</b>

11:18.130 --> 11:20.710
<b>Of course. You are a sentinel, are you not?</b>

11:21.000 --> 11:25.540
<b>I mean, sure. But the only thing I really do
is hang around as your bodyguard.</b>

11:27.080 --> 11:28.000
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

11:28.670 --> 11:30.670
<b>Yeah, yeah. I hear you.</b>

11:35.130 --> 11:38.500
<b>Very well. This brings our meeting to a close.</b>

12:00.330 --> 12:02.880
<b>Are you the only one who has stayed behind?</b>

12:03.330 --> 12:03.880
<b>Yes.</b>

12:04.710 --> 12:06.500
<b>Then we can drop the formalities.</b>

12:17.330 --> 12:18.380
<b>Princess!</b>

12:21.960 --> 12:26.080
<b>C'mon, Jinta. How many times do I gotta tell you?
Quit all the fancy talk.</b>

12:26.250 --> 12:28.080
<b>But you're in a role that's due respect.</b>

12:29.460 --> 12:35.750
<b>I get it may be difficult for you, but I really wish
you'd just use my name when we're alone.</b>

12:36.580 --> 12:40.210
<b>Since at this point, you're the only one left
who can call me that.</b>

12:41.080 --> 12:42.210
<b>Yes, but...</b>

12:47.380 --> 12:48.540
<b>Shirayuki.</b>

12:51.920 --> 12:53.460
<b>Sorry to be so self-centered.</b>

12:53.960 --> 12:54.830
<b>I gotta shape up!</b>

12:55.130 --> 12:56.710
<b>I can't just rely on you forever.</b>

12:57.130 --> 12:58.670
<b>Why is that a problem?</b>

12:59.210 --> 13:02.500
<b>The whole reason the Itsukihime is assigned
a sentinel is for her to depend on them.</b>

13:04.920 --> 13:05.750
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:07.380 --> 13:09.960
<b>By the way, Suzu-chan is here today.</b>

13:11.330 --> 13:11.920
<b>Huh?</b>

13:13.420 --> 13:14.580
<b>Shirayuki?</b>

13:27.880 --> 13:29.880
<b>If she ever gets caught sneaking in here,</b>

13:29.880 --> 13:34.630
<b>she better not come crying to me when they
put her to death for blasphemy against the Itsukihime.</b>

13:34.790 --> 13:36.210
<b>Don't be like that.</b>

13:36.580 --> 13:38.500
<b>Suzu-chan only came here to see you.</b>

13:38.790 --> 13:39.670
<b>Me?</b>

13:41.540 --> 13:44.380
<b>You haven't been home in days
because you were out hunting demons.</b>

13:44.580 --> 13:46.420
<b>I think she couldn't wait any longer.</b>

13:47.080 --> 13:49.380
<b>But that's no reason to break the rules.</b>

13:49.960 --> 13:51.790
<b>Suzune! Wake up!</b>

13:56.580 --> 13:58.210
<b>Good morning, Jinta.</b>

14:00.580 --> 14:01.960
<b>Welcome home!</b>

14:02.380 --> 14:04.210
<b>Thanks. Good to be back.</b>

14:08.290 --> 14:12.330
<b>Suzune. I've told you over and over again
that this shrine is off-limits.</b>

14:12.460 --> 14:14.420
<b>You're not allowed to come here.</b>

14:14.750 --> 14:18.210
<b>Boo! Why do you get to come but I don't?</b>

14:18.830 --> 14:21.330
<b>Those are the rules and you need to follow them.</b>

14:21.330 --> 14:22.580
<b>Okay!</b>

14:23.920 --> 14:25.500
<b>Ah, the struggles of being an older brother.</b>

14:26.290 --> 14:28.540
<b>Someone's coming. Keep quiet, Suzune.</b>

14:28.540 --> 14:30.500
<b>It's okay, I know a secret way out!</b>

14:30.710 --> 14:31.330
<b>Wait!</b>

14:31.790 --> 14:33.130
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

14:38.290 --> 14:39.380
<b>You handled that well.</b>

14:39.750 --> 14:41.710
<b>Suzune-chan is such a sweet girl.</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:44.460
<b>Although she can be a real handful sometimes...</b>

14:55.290 --> 14:58.040
<b>May I have a moment of your time, Princess?</b>

14:58.330 --> 15:01.580
<b>I was hoping to get your answer
to my proposal from the other day.</b>

15:02.330 --> 15:04.170
<b>Ah, I see...</b>

15:05.710 --> 15:07.000
<b>Pardon me.</b>

15:12.710 --> 15:16.790
<b>Jinta. Would you mind
stepping outside for a few minutes?</b>

15:17.290 --> 15:19.250
<b>But, sir, it's my duty to stay by her sid-</b>

15:19.250 --> 15:19.830
<b>Jinta.</b>

15:20.290 --> 15:21.880
<b>You are excused.</b>

15:23.540 --> 15:24.130
<b>As you wish.</b>

15:28.540 --> 15:29.210
<b>Jinta.</b>

15:30.330 --> 15:33.960
<b>The safety of Kadono is in your hands.
Please remain its staunch defender.</b>

15:51.040 --> 15:53.000
<b>Listen, Jinta...</b>

15:53.540 --> 15:55.040
<b>I'm going to become the Itsukihime.</b>

16:00.330 --> 16:03.000
<b>I love this village that my mother gave her life for.</b>

16:03.630 --> 16:07.540
<b>And I want to help keep it strong,
because that feels like the right thing to do.</b>

16:11.920 --> 16:12.630
<b>But it means...</b>

16:13.420 --> 16:14.880
<b>I won't be able to see you again.</b>

16:19.080 --> 16:20.920
<b>Then I'll just work my way up to you.</b>

16:21.670 --> 16:23.210
<b>I don't have what it takes yet.</b>

16:23.670 --> 16:25.130
<b>But I'll get tougher!</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:29.790
<b>I'm going to follow in Motoharu-san's footsteps
and train hard until I can defeat any demon.</b>

16:30.420 --> 16:33.210
<b>Then I can become the village sentinel
and see you again.</b>

16:56.960 --> 16:57.960
<b>How goes it?</b>

16:58.460 --> 16:59.670
<b>Swimmingly.</b>

17:00.080 --> 17:04.500
<b>Even though it's my own ability,
the idea seemed far too absurd for me to believe.</b>

17:05.500 --> 17:08.710
<b>But now I've made sure of it with my own eyes.</b>

17:09.250 --> 17:12.790
<b>There is no doubt. She looks exactly like the one I saw.</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:33.040
<b>Getting a slow start today, huh, Jinta?</b>

17:34.000 --> 17:36.460
<b>I was told I'm not needed
at the shrine until this afternoon.</b>

17:40.750 --> 17:42.540
<b>Oh really?!</b>

17:46.460 --> 17:47.790
<b>Do I have something on my face?</b>

17:48.460 --> 17:50.420
<b>Your bandage is coming undone.</b>

17:53.540 --> 17:54.880
<b>Is it okay now?</b>

17:55.580 --> 17:56.130
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:03.290 --> 18:05.710
<b>We've really found happiness, haven't we?</b>

18:06.330 --> 18:10.250
<b>All I ever need to be happy is you, Jinta.</b>

18:12.210 --> 18:13.250
<b>Good morning!</b>

18:15.040 --> 18:16.130
<b>Princess?</b>

18:19.790 --> 18:21.210
<b>What are you doing here?!</b>

18:21.420 --> 18:22.500
<b>I slipped away!</b>

18:22.920 --> 18:25.790
<b>So come spend the day with me, Jinta!</b>

18:26.040 --> 18:28.380
<b>You slipped away? But the Itsukihime can't-</b>

18:28.380 --> 18:29.460
<b>It's okay.</b>

18:29.630 --> 18:32.290
<b>I already got approval from the chieftain just for today!</b>

18:32.960 --> 18:36.290
<b>C'mon, Jinta! Let's all have breakfast together
like the old days!</b>

18:37.580 --> 18:38.420
<b>Okay...</b>

18:38.710 --> 18:40.000
<b>Hurry up, now!</b>

18:40.000 --> 18:42.500
<b>We can't make the princess serve herself!</b>

18:42.710 --> 18:44.790
<b>Hey, slow down! This isn't a party!</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:56.460
<b>You should've prepared something more fancy.</b>

18:56.460 --> 18:57.420
<b>No whining.</b>

18:57.880 --> 18:59.670
<b>Are you just a bad cook or what?</b>

18:59.670 --> 19:00.750
<b>Don't make me smack you.</b>

19:01.080 --> 19:05.210
<b>Now that's rich. We all know you're too big of a softie
to ever lay a hand on Suzu-chan.</b>

19:06.380 --> 19:08.920
<b>I can be a strict brother when the need arises.</b>

19:09.080 --> 19:10.750
<b>Even if that means getting rough.</b>

19:11.960 --> 19:13.830
<b>It'll never happen in a million years.</b>

19:14.080 --> 19:16.250
<b>You think so, too, huh?</b>

19:16.250 --> 19:18.710
<b>Yep! I mean, you know how Jinta is.</b>

19:18.920 --> 19:20.960
<b>You two are seriously asking for it.</b>

19:22.580 --> 19:24.330
<b>Okay, then go right ahead.</b>

19:24.460 --> 19:26.210
<b>Smack me if you can.</b>

19:36.670 --> 19:39.880
<b>Yeah, well, I guess I'll let you off the hook.</b>

19:40.130 --> 19:41.580
<b>There you have it!</b>

19:51.250 --> 19:52.250
<b>Someone's in a good mood.</b>

19:52.630 --> 19:55.830
<b>Well, duh! You get to spend
a whole day with the princess!</b>

19:56.080 --> 19:58.000
<b>That makes me super happy!</b>

19:58.380 --> 19:59.920
<b>How does that work?</b>

20:00.170 --> 20:02.290
<b>Because I love you, Jinta!</b>

20:02.500 --> 20:05.460
<b>So your happiness is my happiness!</b>

20:09.790 --> 20:10.830
<b>Watch after the house.</b>

20:11.210 --> 20:13.460
<b>'Kay! Have fun!</b>

20:18.790 --> 20:20.830
<b>Alright! Let's go eat some dango!</b>

20:37.330 --> 20:39.080
<b>Suzune-chan's such a sweetie.</b>

20:39.290 --> 20:39.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:43.880 --> 20:46.210
<b>Did I just see Jinta-sama with a beautiful girl in tow...?</b>

20:49.790 --> 20:51.710
<b>Look at that pretty girl hanging around Jinta-sama.</b>

20:51.710 --> 20:53.710
<b>Does Byakuya-sama know about this?!</b>

20:53.710 --> 20:54.920
<b>Talk about scandalous!</b>

20:54.920 --> 20:56.830
<b>DANGO</b>

20:57.000 --> 20:58.830
<b>Hey, Chitose. Pardon the sudden visit.</b>

20:59.040 --> 21:00.710
<b>Oh, Jinta-sama!</b>

21:00.880 --> 21:02.880
<b>Welcome... in?</b>

21:03.500 --> 21:05.170
<b>Um, may I ask who this is?</b>

21:05.170 --> 21:07.960
<b>A friend of mine. Let's just leave it at that.</b>

21:09.830 --> 21:11.540
<b>Gimme 10 orders of dango!</b>

21:11.540 --> 21:12.420
<b>Just two, actually.</b>

21:12.880 --> 21:13.960
<b>And some tea, please.</b>

21:13.960 --> 21:15.040
<b>Boo...</b>

21:19.000 --> 21:21.250
<b>Chitose-chan doesn't recognize me, does she?</b>

21:21.500 --> 21:23.710
<b>She hasn't seen you in person for years now.</b>

21:23.960 --> 21:24.960
<b>What do you expect?</b>

21:25.500 --> 21:27.330
<b>Yeah, I figured as much...</b>

21:36.420 --> 21:37.210
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:38.130 --> 21:39.630
<b>Your order is ready.</b>

21:44.170 --> 21:45.380
<b>I see more than dango...</b>

21:45.380 --> 21:47.710
<b>That's isobe mochi. You loved it as a kid, right?</b>

21:48.130 --> 21:49.290
<b>You remember that?</b>

21:49.830 --> 21:51.920
<b>Yeah. We had some on hand.</b>

21:51.920 --> 21:53.250
<b>So help yourself, Jinta-nii...</b>

21:53.250 --> 21:55.920
<b>Oh, I'm sorry! How rude of me!</b>

21:57.210 --> 21:57.920
<b>I don't mind.</b>

22:04.040 --> 22:04.670
<b>It's great!</b>

22:06.750 --> 22:08.710
<b>Please enjoy yourselves.</b>

22:12.330 --> 22:14.580
<b>She's a real bundle of nerves, huh?</b>

22:14.750 --> 22:16.250
<b>I don't blame her.</b>

22:16.790 --> 22:18.750
<b>Things have changed between us.</b>

22:18.750 --> 22:22.000
<b>I'm no longer a big brother figure. I'm the village sentinel.</b>

22:23.460 --> 22:24.460
<b>That makes sense.</b>

22:28.460 --> 22:30.210
<b>"Nothing is forever."</b>

22:30.790 --> 22:32.790
<b>One of dad's favorite catchphrases.</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:33.670
<b>Yeah.</b>

22:33.880 --> 22:38.290
<b>He was always trying to teach me
important life lessons like that.</b>

22:39.380 --> 22:44.000
<b>Even now, it feels like he's guiding me
to follow in his footsteps.</b>

22:44.920 --> 22:45.880
<b>That's good.</b>

22:46.880 --> 22:48.630
<b>I hope we can live up to mom and dad.</b>

22:49.210 --> 22:53.500
<b>By keeping the majesty of Kadono village safe
just like they did.</b>

22:54.500 --> 22:55.250
<b>Yeah.</b>

23:03.880 --> 23:04.880
<b>Thanks for coming.</b>

23:05.290 --> 23:07.250
<b>Same. I had a good time today.</b>

23:07.540 --> 23:09.670
<b>I see. I'm glad to hear that.</b>

23:10.670 --> 23:13.250
<b>I felt bad making you go along
with another of my selfish whims...</b>

23:17.710 --> 23:19.290
<b>So, are you satisfied?</b>

23:19.670 --> 23:20.290
<b>Mm-hm.</b>

23:24.630 --> 23:27.420
<b>Actually, I just wanted a chance for us to talk here.</b>

23:28.210 --> 23:30.290
<b>This is where it all started for me.</b>

23:31.380 --> 23:33.880
<b>Which is why I thought it was
the best place to share my news.</b>

23:34.670 --> 23:36.380
<b>So, will you hear me out?</b>

23:37.380 --> 23:37.880
<b>Sure.</b>

23:42.500 --> 23:45.170
<b>I'm going... to marry Kiyomasa.</b>

23:49.580 --> 23:51.880
<b>I got lectured by the chieftain yesterday.</b>

23:52.790 --> 23:54.460
<b>He said that if demons are coming for me,</b>

23:54.960 --> 23:58.630
<b>then I should bear a successor
before I end up like mom did.</b>

24:00.080 --> 24:03.710
<b>Kiyomasa is a sentinel. Plus, he was born in Kadono.</b>

24:04.210 --> 24:06.080
<b>And eventually, he'll become the village chieftain.</b>

24:07.790 --> 24:11.130
<b>The idea is that our marriage
would be to the benefit of everyone.</b>

24:13.920 --> 24:15.790
<b>And I'm inclined to agree.</b>

24:19.210 --> 24:22.580
<b>But speaking as Shirayuki, I want you to know...</b>

24:28.130 --> 24:30.880
<b>...I love you, Jinta.</b>

24:34.670 --> 24:36.330
<b>But I must live as Byakuya now.</b>

24:36.920 --> 24:38.670
<b>I can't go back to being Shirayuki.</b>

24:40.330 --> 24:45.420
<b>To be perfectly honest, I was ready to leave
and start a life with you somewhere else.</b>

24:46.630 --> 24:50.500
<b>But I knew that was a choice you would never make.</b>

24:51.460 --> 24:52.420
<b>You're right.</b>

24:52.960 --> 24:55.710
<b>Because you're not in love with me?</b>

24:56.750 --> 25:01.380
<b>I swore an oath to protect Byakuya. Not Shirayuki.</b>

25:02.330 --> 25:05.500
<b>I worked myself to the bone learning
how to wield the blade when I was young,</b>

25:06.040 --> 25:10.790
<b>because you courageously took up the mantle
of Itsukihime and I respected you for it.</b>

25:12.630 --> 25:15.290
<b>So if I make the choice to run away with you now,</b>

25:15.960 --> 25:18.130
<b>it would be a waste of all my training,</b>

25:18.920 --> 25:21.170
<b>and an affront to what you stand for.</b>

25:22.130 --> 25:26.000
<b>I... could never live with that.</b>

25:27.080 --> 25:29.380
<b>You and I are truly birds of a feather.</b>

25:30.130 --> 25:35.380
<b>When all's said and done, we can't help but prioritize
how we live our lives over who we live them with.</b>

25:36.920 --> 25:39.250
<b>I made the choice to become the Itsukihime.</b>

25:40.210 --> 25:44.710
<b>And I could never look you in the face again
if I cast that identity aside now.</b>

25:45.670 --> 25:51.580
<b>Because if following this path was just a mistake,
then the same would be true of my feelings for you.</b>

25:53.500 --> 25:54.380
<b>That's why...</b>

25:55.170 --> 25:57.250
<b>I will continue to live as the Itsukihime.</b>

26:01.580 --> 26:05.960
<b>So that my heart remains true,
and my love for you thrives until the very end.</b>

26:06.830 --> 26:07.540
<b>Okay.</b>

26:08.290 --> 26:13.170
<b>Then I'll do the same, and keep living as your sentinel
to protect you always.</b>

26:13.960 --> 26:14.630
<b>Okay.</b>

26:29.250 --> 26:32.540
<b>There have been two demons
sighted prowling the Tabu Forest.</b>

26:33.040 --> 26:35.080
<b>Kiyomasa shall stay here to guard Kadono.</b>

26:35.580 --> 26:39.000
<b>Meanwhile, you shall enter the forest
and fulfill your duties as sentinel.</b>

26:39.380 --> 26:42.380
<b>Understood. I shall slay these demons with all haste.</b>

26:46.000 --> 26:47.710
<b>May fortune be with you.</b>

26:54.420 --> 26:55.080
<b>Hey.</b>

26:56.920 --> 26:57.670
<b>Stop!</b>

26:59.380 --> 27:01.000
<b>What's with the silent act?</b>

27:01.170 --> 27:03.170
<b>You've heard the news about me and Byakuya, right?</b>

27:04.130 --> 27:04.830
<b>Yeah.</b>

27:05.080 --> 27:06.830
<b>And you're okay with it?!</b>

27:07.170 --> 27:08.750
<b>What the hell is going through your head?!</b>

27:08.960 --> 27:12.710
<b>Nothing. Only the happiness of our princess
and the peace of our village.</b>

27:13.130 --> 27:15.170
<b>Don't pretend you're not in love with her, too!</b>

27:18.170 --> 27:20.170
<b>How can you be all right with this?</b>

27:21.670 --> 27:24.080
<b>You're out of your mind, man.</b>

27:25.210 --> 27:26.790
<b>Yes, I'm well aware.</b>

27:43.000 --> 27:45.040
<b>Why hello there, little missy.</b>

28:13.170 --> 28:16.080
<b>Damn, that attack was supposed to blindside you.</b>

28:16.540 --> 28:19.420
<b>You're alone? I heard there were two of you.</b>

28:19.920 --> 28:22.210
<b>My companion had business in Kadono.</b>

28:23.330 --> 28:24.130
<b>I see.</b>

29:06.960 --> 29:08.750
<b>I knew this would be fun.</b>

29:10.630 --> 29:15.630
<b>We demons can easily live for more than a century,
while you humans only last for a fraction of that.</b>

29:16.080 --> 29:22.080
<b>And yet, humans can outlive themselves
by passing down their dreams and techniques to others.</b>

29:23.040 --> 29:25.290
<b>It's truly fascinating.</b>

29:26.040 --> 29:27.670
<b>I simply must know.</b>

29:28.130 --> 29:30.880
<b>Why do you wield that blade, human?</b>

29:31.500 --> 29:35.420
<b>You've defied nature to amass power, but for what end?</b>

29:36.830 --> 29:37.880
<b>For my people.</b>

29:38.460 --> 29:41.080
<b>I will cut down whoever threatens those I must protect!</b>

29:41.960 --> 29:44.920
<b>So, do you know what I am?</b>

29:45.920 --> 29:46.880
<b>A demon...</b>

29:47.500 --> 29:49.790
<b>Yep. The same as you.</b>

29:50.130 --> 29:51.830
<b>We're both demons.</b>

29:52.330 --> 29:53.710
<b>No! I'm not!</b>

29:54.710 --> 29:55.750
<b>I'm human...</b>

29:59.130 --> 30:01.380
<b>Sibling love. Isn't that just sweet?</b>

30:01.790 --> 30:02.420
<b>Huh?</b>

30:02.540 --> 30:06.380
<b>I mean, your love for your brother
is what compels you to be human, right?</b>

30:06.920 --> 30:11.290
<b>He must have been a very loyal defender
to make you feel that way.</b>

30:11.500 --> 30:13.420
<b>I honestly find it impressive.</b>

30:15.290 --> 30:16.000
<b>Mm-hm!</b>

30:16.630 --> 30:18.750
<b>You think the world of him, huh?</b>

30:20.080 --> 30:21.210
<b>Of course!</b>

30:21.420 --> 30:23.130
<b>Because he's my everything!</b>

30:25.880 --> 30:27.710
<b>A young woman at heart, I see.</b>

30:32.040 --> 30:34.580
<b>You might care to know that someone
is out to hurt your brother.</b>

30:35.330 --> 30:37.420
<b>Will you use your power to help me?</b>

30:37.630 --> 30:39.250
<b>My power?</b>

30:39.460 --> 30:42.420
<b>Yes. All you need to do is come with me.</b>

30:43.380 --> 30:46.080
<b>Don't worry. We demons never lie.</b>

30:46.080 --> 30:48.380
<b>I promise that I'm not going to hurt you.</b>

30:50.920 --> 30:51.710
<b>No way!</b>

30:52.130 --> 30:55.920
<b>Even if I know you won't hurt me,
you still might hurt my brother!</b>

30:56.500 --> 30:57.380
<b>That's fair.</b>

30:58.330 --> 31:00.670
<b>But will you feel the same after seeing this?</b>

31:24.210 --> 31:25.330
<b>What was that...?</b>

31:25.920 --> 31:27.790
<b>I have the power of foresight.</b>

31:28.250 --> 31:33.750
<b>And I can share my visions of the future with others,
although they only get a brief glimpse at it.</b>

31:35.170 --> 31:37.670
<b>That's NOT what I want to know! Was it real?!</b>

31:38.000 --> 31:39.210
<b>Did she really...?</b>

31:40.960 --> 31:43.210
<b>Oh, it's all very real.</b>

31:43.500 --> 31:44.250
<b>You're lying.</b>

31:44.790 --> 31:46.040
<b>Don't believe me?</b>

31:46.540 --> 31:48.250
<b>Then come along and see for yourself.</b>

31:48.880 --> 31:49.540
<b>Huh?</b>

31:55.960 --> 31:57.420
<b>Do it for your brother.</b>

31:58.290 --> 31:59.920
<b>For Jinta...?</b>

32:27.670 --> 32:29.040
<b>My turn to ask a question.</b>

32:29.290 --> 32:32.040
<b>Tell me, demon. Why do you bring harm to humans?</b>

32:32.500 --> 32:34.250
<b>Because of what I am.</b>

32:34.580 --> 32:36.790
<b>You mean to say demons kill humans by nature?</b>

32:37.290 --> 32:38.040
<b>Not really.</b>

32:38.540 --> 32:41.920
<b>But we exist to fulfill
an intended purpose and mine is here.</b>

32:42.330 --> 32:46.380
<b>Therefore, I work towards that end.
And I'm helpless to do anything else.</b>

32:47.080 --> 32:49.880
<b>Demons cannot defy their nature as demons.</b>

32:51.790 --> 32:53.250
<b>You can't exercise any restraint?</b>

32:53.420 --> 32:55.380
<b>We wouldn't be called demons otherwise.</b>

32:56.170 --> 32:57.210
<b>All right.</b>

32:57.750 --> 32:59.210
<b>Then I will show you no mercy.</b>

32:59.420 --> 33:00.540
<b>A wise choice.</b>

33:01.290 --> 33:03.130
<b>For I have the power of assimilation.</b>

33:03.460 --> 33:05.920
<b>I feast upon other demons to gain their power,</b>

33:06.170 --> 33:09.170
<b>which gives me such monstrous strength
that it alters my very anatomy!</b>

34:06.210 --> 34:08.420
<b>I have now fulfilled my purpose.</b>

34:09.750 --> 34:13.670
<b>The other demon I was working with
has the power of foresight.</b>

34:14.130 --> 34:17.080
<b>And she has seen far into the future.</b>

34:17.210 --> 34:19.580
<b>170 years, to be exact.</b>

34:20.420 --> 34:26.170
<b>When the advent of an evil deity who rules
over demonkind takes place here in Kadono.</b>

34:27.080 --> 34:31.750
<b>That's how we learned the demon of all demons
actually lives right in this village.</b>

34:31.920 --> 34:34.830
<b>It's the whole reason we came.</b>

34:35.330 --> 34:38.130
<b>A demon that lives in Kadono...?</b>

34:44.460 --> 34:46.290
<b>Take this, human.</b>

34:46.920 --> 34:48.210
<b>Consider it a parting gift.</b>

34:51.880 --> 34:57.130
<b>You said you wield that sword
for those you must protect.</b>

34:57.630 --> 34:59.380
<b>Now let me ask you a new question.</b>

34:59.830 --> 35:04.790
<b>What happens when those you've sworn to protect
are no longer worthy of that protection?</b>

35:04.880 --> 35:07.750
<b>Who will you cut down then?!</b>

35:09.830 --> 35:13.290
<b>Tell me, human. Why do you wield that blade?</b>

35:15.500 --> 35:16.500
<b>Kiyomasa?</b>

35:17.540 --> 35:19.210
<b>Stop! Now is not the time.</b>

35:19.540 --> 35:21.710
<b>At least wait until we know that Jinta is safe!</b>

35:22.130 --> 35:23.630
<b>Now is the best time.</b>

35:24.000 --> 35:25.790
<b>If we're lucky, this one night will be all it takes.</b>

35:26.420 --> 35:30.580
<b>Or do you want me to wait?
So that he can be around to hear you moaning?</b>

35:32.170 --> 35:33.630
<b>It's up to you.</b>

35:35.960 --> 35:37.670
<b>Well, I...</b>

35:39.000 --> 35:40.380
<b>But I'll get tougher!</b>

35:40.670 --> 35:44.750
<b>I'm going to follow in Motoharu-san's footsteps
and train hard until I can defeat any demon.</b>

35:57.290 --> 36:00.250
<b>I chose this path for the sake of Kadono.</b>

36:09.210 --> 36:11.750
<b>And this is what the Itsukihime must do.</b>

36:12.380 --> 36:14.210
<b>Y-you're both crazy...</b>

36:23.670 --> 36:26.460
<b>See? It wasn't an illusion.</b>

36:35.960 --> 36:37.750
<b>Suzu-chan...?</b>

36:39.710 --> 36:42.630
<b>Why, princess? Why?</b>

36:48.250 --> 36:49.500
<b>I'm not dead...</b>

37:02.710 --> 37:03.580
<b>Suzune!</b>

37:13.500 --> 37:16.830
<b>I thought you were in love with Jinta, princess.</b>

37:17.290 --> 37:21.420
<b>But it looks like you're willing to settle for any guy, huh?</b>

37:21.580 --> 37:22.460
<b>N-no!</b>

37:22.460 --> 37:23.500
<b>Then explain this!</b>

37:24.250 --> 37:25.880
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

37:27.000 --> 37:29.290
<b>What did I suffer for?</b>

37:32.380 --> 37:35.290
<b>No matter how much it tore my heart apart,</b>

37:35.920 --> 37:40.460
<b>I still pushed for you and Jinta
to be together with everything I had.</b>

37:41.040 --> 37:44.790
<b>Because I knew it would make him happy.</b>

37:45.540 --> 37:47.000
<b>That was the only reason.</b>

37:47.710 --> 37:51.250
<b>Seeing him get close to anyone
would have been unbearable otherwise!</b>

37:51.750 --> 37:54.920
<b>But after all that... you do this?!</b>

37:57.130 --> 37:59.330
<b>Suzu-chan, I see now...</b>

38:00.330 --> 38:01.630
<b>You did it for Jinta.</b>

38:02.330 --> 38:03.790
<b>You truly love him.</b>

38:04.460 --> 38:09.880
<b>That's why you kept your body and mind
from ever growing, to stay as his little sister, right?</b>

38:10.460 --> 38:13.830
<b>I believed in you. I was ready to grin and bear it.</b>

38:14.330 --> 38:15.330
<b>But after this?!</b>

38:15.710 --> 38:16.500
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

38:17.460 --> 38:21.130
<b>But there is only one person who I can be now.</b>

38:22.380 --> 38:24.790
<b>I must live as the Itsukihime to preserve Kadono's legacy.</b>

38:25.500 --> 38:29.080
<b>Because that's the only way I can think of
to properly repay his feelings.</b>

38:31.460 --> 38:33.080
<b>Are you serious?</b>

38:37.460 --> 38:41.330
<b>You took everything that I ever wanted,</b>

38:41.710 --> 38:44.630
<b>and now you're going to throw it away
for a bunch of nobodies?</b>

38:45.790 --> 38:48.380
<b>How dare you? How dare you?</b>

38:58.000 --> 39:01.750
<b>Do you just enjoy making me look like a fool or what?!</b>

39:01.750 --> 39:02.790
<b>Listen, I...</b>

39:05.040 --> 39:07.920
<b>Shut that rotten mouth of yours right now.</b>

39:08.540 --> 39:11.380
<b>See? Everything I told you was true.</b>

39:11.830 --> 39:14.170
<b>The princess here is a no-good bitch.</b>

39:14.710 --> 39:16.290
<b>She's not worth saving.</b>

39:16.580 --> 39:21.790
<b>Your darling brother is out there risking his life for her,
yet she's here stabbing him in the back.</b>

39:22.000 --> 39:25.290
<b>She thinks it's hilarious to watch him fight so hard
without knowing the truth.</b>

39:22.460 --> 39:25.290
<b>Suzu-chan! Don't listen to that monster!</b>

39:25.580 --> 39:30.920
<b>Doesn't it just make you angry that your brother
has to get hurt on behalf of this despicable whore?</b>

39:25.590 --> 39:30.920
<b>Suzu-chan! Look at me! Please, Suzu-chan! Suzu-chan!</b>

39:31.500 --> 39:34.830
<b>That demon is lying to you! Don't believe her!</b>

39:31.500 --> 39:35.830
<b>So, let's think. What can you do to help your brother out?</b>

39:36.960 --> 39:40.330
<b>Here's an idea: Maybe it's better if she's dead.</b>

39:41.080 --> 39:43.210
<b>Suzu-chan! Please no!</b>

40:03.670 --> 40:04.920
<b>Suzu-chan?</b>

40:05.710 --> 40:07.750
<b>Whatever, princess.</b>

40:08.040 --> 40:09.000
<b>Just die.</b>

40:12.790 --> 40:14.500
<b>Not so fast, playboy.</b>

40:14.790 --> 40:17.170
<b>This is a fight between women only!</b>

40:21.380 --> 40:23.830
<b>You should have the power to draw that sword now.</b>

40:24.290 --> 40:29.170
<b>And I bet the princess will die happy knowing that she
was killed by the very blade her people worshipped.</b>

40:30.170 --> 40:32.460
<b>I still have my uses for this guy, though.</b>

40:35.960 --> 40:37.130
<b>Enjoy yourselves!</b>

40:44.830 --> 40:46.290
<b>This is gonna be fun.</b>

40:47.080 --> 40:48.290
<b>Suzu-chan...?</b>

40:56.500 --> 40:57.880
<b>Shirayuki! Suzune!</b>

41:19.080 --> 41:20.880
<b>Shirayuki...?</b>

41:29.540 --> 41:32.080
<b>Welcome back! I hope you're not hurt!</b>

41:40.830 --> 41:42.460
<b>I'm going to become the Itsukihime.</b>

41:40.830 --> 41:42.460
<b>Let's be friends, okay?</b>

41:42.580 --> 41:45.750
<b>I'm trying to be a good big sister and cheer you up.</b>

41:43.380 --> 41:44.500
<b>I slipped away!</b>

41:44.500 --> 41:45.750
<b>We're all going to be family.</b>

41:46.000 --> 41:48.290
<b>I love you, Jinta.</b>

42:11.000 --> 42:13.630
<b>That was close! What's the big idea?</b>

42:20.130 --> 42:22.080
<b>Are you okay, Jinta?</b>

42:22.170 --> 42:23.420
<b>Did something happen?</b>

42:25.500 --> 42:26.830
<b>Is that you, Suzune...?</b>

42:27.000 --> 42:27.670
<b>Yeah!</b>

42:28.500 --> 42:29.290
<b>Really?</b>

42:29.750 --> 42:31.000
<b>Yeah, obviously!</b>

42:32.000 --> 42:32.710
<b>Then why?</b>

42:33.290 --> 42:35.250
<b>Why did you do that to Shirayuki?</b>

42:36.210 --> 42:38.130
<b>What's with the long face?</b>

42:38.580 --> 42:40.630
<b>I killed the princess for you.</b>

42:40.880 --> 42:42.330
<b>You should be smiling!</b>

42:42.500 --> 42:44.460
<b>How does that make sense...?</b>

42:45.000 --> 42:48.920
<b>Oh, let me explain. The princess was
going to get married to some other guy.</b>

42:49.290 --> 42:53.670
<b>She was just a no-good cheating bitch
who totally lied about being in love with you.</b>

42:54.040 --> 42:57.420
<b>So there's no reason for you to feel sad!</b>

42:58.790 --> 43:00.500
<b>Please, just stop...</b>

43:01.920 --> 43:05.380
<b>Oh no, don't tell me you still love her?</b>

43:06.000 --> 43:09.830
<b>Even though she stabbed you in the back?
You're really going to mourn her?</b>

43:10.830 --> 43:12.210
<b>Oh! But wait!</b>

43:12.460 --> 43:18.130
<b>Now that she's dead, you don't have to go through
the stress of watching her marry that other guy!</b>

43:18.580 --> 43:19.790
<b>Isn't that great?</b>

43:21.670 --> 43:24.380
<b>Hey, can we go home now? I'm exhausted!</b>

43:24.630 --> 43:25.920
<b>"Exhausted"?</b>

43:26.210 --> 43:29.330
<b>Yep! There were a lot of annoyances to get rid of.</b>

43:29.630 --> 43:33.210
<b>You betrayed the good people of Kadono
who raised us like their own,</b>

43:33.540 --> 43:35.000
<b>and even killed Shirayuki.</b>

43:35.630 --> 43:39.500
<b>Everything is in ruins and you have nothing
to say for yourself except you're "exhausted'?!</b>

43:40.000 --> 43:41.330
<b>Uh, is that a problem?</b>

43:42.710 --> 43:44.080
<b>Ah, I get it...</b>

43:46.170 --> 43:51.130
<b>The Suzune who I knew is already long gone, isn't she?</b>

43:59.580 --> 44:00.750
<b>Jinta?</b>

44:02.790 --> 44:04.080
<b>I'm so pathetic.</b>

44:05.710 --> 44:08.750
<b>Literally everything has slipped through my fingers.</b>

44:17.130 --> 44:18.210
<b>No, wait.</b>

44:19.040 --> 44:21.540
<b>I guess I do have one thing left.</b>

44:22.250 --> 44:25.250
<b>I don't understand. Why are you looking at me like that?</b>

44:24.130 --> 44:27.790
<b>My pure hatred for anything and everything.</b>

44:25.580 --> 44:27.790
<b>I only did this to make you happy!</b>

44:27.790 --> 44:29.330
<b>That's why I killed that slut!</b>

44:29.330 --> 44:30.750
<b>Enough! Shut up!</b>

44:40.750 --> 44:41.750
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

44:43.000 --> 44:45.790
<b>You're going to abandon me just like everyone else, huh?</b>

44:47.630 --> 44:50.080
<b>You know, I thought you were different.</b>

44:50.540 --> 44:53.750
<b>That you of all people would always be on my side.</b>

44:55.330 --> 44:56.250
<b>Fine then.</b>

44:56.670 --> 44:59.080
<b>I don't need you. I'm done having faith!</b>

44:59.540 --> 45:04.670
<b>You were my everything, but if you can't appreciate me
for who I am, then to hell with it!</b>

45:05.540 --> 45:06.460
<b>Screw this world!</b>

45:07.080 --> 45:08.460
<b>AND SCREW YOU!</b>

45:12.210 --> 45:13.710
<b>Why don't you just give up?!</b>

45:13.830 --> 45:16.500
<b>There's no point in wasting your life! Not anymore!</b>

45:16.500 --> 45:17.750
<b>I told you to shut up!</b>

45:25.670 --> 45:26.630
<b>Fine.</b>

45:26.960 --> 45:28.040
<b>Then die!</b>

45:46.000 --> 45:47.920
<b>Okay, then go right ahead.</b>

45:47.920 --> 45:49.630
<b>Smack me if you can.</b>

46:03.710 --> 46:04.960
<b>That wasn't enough?</b>

46:07.290 --> 46:08.290
<b>All right, then.</b>

46:20.710 --> 46:21.880
<b>You damn demons!</b>

46:24.210 --> 46:25.380
<b>Run along, dear.</b>

46:42.380 --> 46:43.880
<b>Wait, Suzune!</b>

46:45.130 --> 46:47.710
<b>I hate everything now.</b>

46:48.170 --> 46:50.170
<b>So I'm just going to rip it to shreds.</b>

46:50.670 --> 46:56.630
<b>People, nations, and every last thing
that exists in this world. I will destroy it all.</b>

46:57.330 --> 46:58.500
<b>Remember me.</b>

46:59.290 --> 47:05.000
<b>Because no matter how much time passes,
I'll be coming to pay you one last visit before the end.</b>

47:11.290 --> 47:13.460
<b>Oh yes! Sweet victory!</b>

47:14.080 --> 47:16.790
<b>I have now fulfilled my purpose!</b>

47:19.710 --> 47:22.750
<b>This is what you monsters consider your purpose?</b>

47:22.880 --> 47:24.130
<b>Mindless bloodshed?!</b>

47:25.630 --> 47:26.500
<b>That's right.</b>

47:27.630 --> 47:29.250
<b>I've seen the future.</b>

47:29.880 --> 47:33.790
<b>We demons can't hope to keep up
with how quickly the times will change.</b>

47:34.330 --> 47:37.960
<b>The darkness will get illuminated
by manmade light, robbing us of our homes.</b>

47:38.630 --> 47:43.170
<b>And eventually, "demons" will be nothing more
than myths from the days of old.</b>

47:44.290 --> 47:45.290
<b>But now...</b>

47:46.330 --> 47:47.790
<b>I can die happy.</b>

47:48.500 --> 47:50.630
<b>The future of my brethren is secure.</b>

48:17.960 --> 48:22.080
<b>Some sentinel that I am. After all my tough talk...</b>

48:22.960 --> 48:25.210
<b>I couldn't do a single damn thing.</b>

48:25.750 --> 48:27.460
<b>I protected nothing!</b>

48:29.080 --> 48:33.130
<b>Shirayuki... I loved you so much.</b>

49:28.920 --> 49:31.880
<b>DANGO</b>

49:30.000 --> 49:31.290
<b>I'm leaving Kadono.</b>

49:32.670 --> 49:34.790
<b>I must retrain myself from scratch.</b>

49:35.710 --> 49:38.750
<b>And prepare to fend off the demon god
that will unleash their wrath upon this land.</b>

49:39.750 --> 49:40.830
<b>Are you sure?</b>

49:41.170 --> 49:44.460
<b>Because if that story is true,
I can only assume the demon god is...</b>

49:44.460 --> 49:46.830
<b>I must end this, one way or another.</b>

49:47.210 --> 49:50.130
<b>So, you'll surrender to rage and kill your own sister?</b>

49:50.630 --> 49:53.830
<b>Come now, Jinta. Surely that isn't
what your heart desires.</b>

49:54.000 --> 49:56.170
<b>Suzune is my darling sister.</b>

49:56.500 --> 49:57.880
<b>But I loved Shirayuki, too.</b>

49:58.420 --> 50:00.630
<b>And I can't help but hate her murderer.</b>

50:01.250 --> 50:03.790
<b>I am consumed by malice that speaks to me even now.</b>

50:04.540 --> 50:05.880
<b>Urging me to kill Suzune.</b>

50:07.580 --> 50:12.460
<b>However... if it's possible,
I do wish to find a peaceful solution.</b>

50:13.170 --> 50:18.170
<b>Now that you've turned into a demon,
I thought slaughter was all you would care for.</b>

50:18.750 --> 50:22.380
<b>But it seems you still have some decency left in you.</b>

50:23.420 --> 50:24.670
<b>Please take this.</b>

50:30.880 --> 50:31.790
<b>Try to unsheathe it.</b>

50:40.040 --> 50:43.080
<b>This now makes you the owner of Yarai.</b>

50:43.880 --> 50:47.250
<b>Which means we should follow tradition
and add the "night" kanji to your name.</b>

50:47.500 --> 50:49.880
<b>From here on out, you will be "Jinya."</b>

50:50.250 --> 50:52.580
<b>But, sir, it's not right for me to have this...</b>

50:52.960 --> 50:58.380
<b>The Itsukihime lineage has ended,
so that blade will only gather dust in the shrine.</b>

50:58.750 --> 51:00.710
<b>It's better off in your hands now.</b>

51:01.460 --> 51:05.630
<b>Besides, I'm sure the princess can rest happier that way.</b>

51:10.210 --> 51:11.130
<b>Please forgive me!</b>

51:12.210 --> 51:16.830
<b>I knew all about the love
that you and the princess shared with each other!</b>

51:17.080 --> 51:21.540
<b>But at the same time,
I knew that Kiyomasa had feelings for her.</b>

51:22.210 --> 51:24.710
<b>Although I claimed it was for the sake of Kadono,</b>

51:24.830 --> 51:29.630
<b>I really only pushed for their marriage
because I wanted my son to be happy!</b>

51:30.580 --> 51:33.540
<b>This tragedy falls on my shoulders.</b>

51:41.210 --> 51:46.290
<b>If you intend to revisit Kadono many moons in the future,</b>

51:46.540 --> 51:49.830
<b>then the least I can do is atone
by erecting a shrine in your honor.</b>

51:50.210 --> 51:53.080
<b>It shall be called... the Jinta Shrine.</b>

51:54.040 --> 51:58.250
<b>Although people and towns
never last as long as demons do,</b>

51:58.790 --> 52:02.420
<b>there are some things we can make in our short lives
that withstand the test the time.</b>

52:04.170 --> 52:05.330
<b>Jinta-nii!</b>

52:06.880 --> 52:08.420
<b>You're really leaving?</b>

52:09.670 --> 52:13.290
<b>In my eyes, you're still the same person
that you've always been!</b>

52:18.420 --> 52:21.830
<b>I'll be back again.
Save some isobe mochi for me, will you?</b>

52:22.790 --> 52:24.080
<b>Do you promise?</b>

52:24.420 --> 52:26.380
<b>Because I'm holding you to that!</b>

52:42.580 --> 52:44.000
<b>I understand now.</b>

52:44.670 --> 52:49.380
<b>I know why that demon seemed so content
as it claimed it had "fulfilled its purpose."</b>

52:51.750 --> 52:54.670
<b>170 years, huh?</b>

52:59.710 --> 53:04.380
<b>I always thought the events of the distant past
had nothing to do with me.</b>

53:05.460 --> 53:08.380
<b>But, as it turns out, the reason behind his tears..</b>

53:08.380 --> 53:09.420
<b>Pardon me.</b>

53:09.880 --> 53:12.790
<b>...was directly connected to the reason
that I'm here right now.</b>

53:13.080 --> 53:14.920
<b>Are you the Miko of this shrine?</b>

53:15.380 --> 53:17.250
<b>I would soon come to learn...</b>

53:17.830 --> 53:21.380
<b>...all about the long journey that he had taken...</b>

53:22.040 --> 53:23.750
<b>...for the past 170 years.</b>
